# 6. DATABASE SCHEMA

# products table

```sql
id UUID PRIMARY KEY
name TEXT
slug TEXT UNIQUE
category TEXT
wood_type TEXT
price NUMERIC
original_price NUMERIC
description TEXT
dimensions JSONB
images TEXT[]
stock INTEGER
sku TEXT UNIQUE
is_featured BOOLEAN
is_active BOOLEAN
rating NUMERIC
review_count INTEGER
created_at TIMESTAMP
```

---

# orders table

```sql
id UUID PRIMARY KEY
user_id UUID
status TEXT
total_amount NUMERIC
subtotal NUMERIC
gst_amount NUMERIC
delivery_charge NUMERIC
shipping_address JSONB
razorpay_order_id TEXT
razorpay_payment_id TEXT
promo_code TEXT
discount_amount NUMERIC
created_at TIMESTAMP
```

---

# order_items table

```sql
id UUID PRIMARY KEY
order_id UUID
product_id UUID
quantity INTEGER
price_at_purchase NUMERIC
```

---

