# 15. PAYMENT FLOW

## Flow

1. User clicks Place Order
2. Backend creates Razorpay order
3. Frontend opens Razorpay modal
4. User completes payment
5. Backend verifies signature
6. Order status updated
7. Stock reduced
8. Redirect to success page

